1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
We finally closed one of the most important loops

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
in my AI world.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
For a while, Underworld was one-way.

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Something happened. A character talked.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
The conversation became memory.

6
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
But the character's state did not really move forward.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
The missing edge was conversation changes emotion.

8
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
And emotion changes the next conversation.

9
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Not as "happy plus five."

10
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
More like: warmer, worried, guarded, quieter.

11
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
This is not sentience.

12
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
It is a functional affective loop.

13
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:37,000
And the test is simple:

14
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:41,000
when you return tomorrow, is yesterday still there?
